## Sound: volume levelling, dialogue boost, equaliser, balance, mono, gapless play.

unit-decibels = { $value } dB

settings-viewing-sound-levelling = Volume levelling
settings-viewing-sound-levelling-help = Plays every file at the same loudness, using its ReplayGain, R128 or Sound Check tags. Automatic uses the album’s level when an album plays in order.
settings-viewing-sound-levelling-off = Off
settings-viewing-sound-levelling-track = Each file
settings-viewing-sound-levelling-album = Album
settings-viewing-sound-levelling-auto = Automatic
settings-viewing-sound-levelling-preamp = Levelling preamp
settings-viewing-sound-levelling-preamp-help = Added to every levelled file.
settings-viewing-sound-prevent-clipping = Prevent clipping
settings-viewing-sound-prevent-clipping-help = Never turns a file up past its loudest peak.
settings-viewing-sound-measure-untagged = Measure files without tags
settings-viewing-sound-measure-untagged-help = Measures loudness while a file plays and levels it slowly.
settings-viewing-sound-dialogue-boost = Dialogue boost
settings-viewing-sound-dialogue-boost-help = Makes speech clearer and loud scenes quieter. The d key turns it on and off.
settings-viewing-sound-dialogue-strength = Dialogue boost strength
settings-viewing-sound-dialogue-strength-help = How strongly speech is lifted and loud sounds are tamed.
settings-viewing-sound-equaliser = Equaliser
settings-viewing-sound-equaliser-help = Shapes the sound with ten bands. The e key opens its panel.
settings-viewing-sound-eq-preset = Equaliser preset
settings-viewing-sound-eq-preset-help = The equaliser’s preset.
settings-viewing-sound-eq-bands = Equaliser bands
settings-viewing-sound-eq-bands-help = The ten bands’ gains in dB.
settings-viewing-sound-eq-preamp = Equaliser preamp
settings-viewing-sound-eq-preamp-help = The level before the bands.
settings-viewing-sound-eq-user-presets = Your equaliser presets
settings-viewing-sound-eq-user-presets-help = Presets you saved, one per line.
settings-viewing-sound-balance = Balance
settings-viewing-sound-balance-help = Below 0 favours the left, above 0 the right.
settings-viewing-sound-mono = Mono sound
settings-viewing-sound-mono-help = Plays both channels in each ear.
settings-viewing-sound-crossfade = Crossfade between files
settings-viewing-sound-crossfade-help = Fades one file into the next. Never between files of one album.

